    <string name="privacy_title">Privacy policy</string>
    <string name="privacy_body">Data collected: what you enter, including sessions, notes, injuries, weight, competitions, and class and student data (instructor mode).\n\nStorage: everything stays on this device, in an encrypted database (SQLCipher). The key is protected by the Android Keystore. Health data is not sent to servers.\n\nPurpose: showing statistics, alerts and reminders inside the app.\n\nSharing: none. You decide when to export or share files.\n\nYour rights: export your data, correct it in the edit screens, and delete it under Profile, Data and privacy.</string>
